		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Problem with timeout beeps on DMR]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2052&amp;p=17202#p17202"><![CDATA[
There is currently a problem with the timeout beeps on DMR effecting the DMR transmission<br>The end of the transmission can be interrupted, or the radio can switch to the wrong timeslot when the timeout beeps are played.<br><br>Please disable the timeout beeps in the Sound options settings if you notice any of these problems<br><br>We are investigating a fix for this at the moment.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Jan 22, 2022 6:32 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
